WEBVTT

1
00:00:07,090 --> 00:00:08,050
Is this the location?

2
00:00:08,330 --> 00:00:09,770
Yes, right here

3
00:00:12,050 --> 00:00:13,010
Xuanmei and I found out

4
00:00:13,130 --> 00:00:14,490
There are quite a few people in these buildings.

5
00:00:14,810 --> 00:00:16,170
I checked online and found out

6
00:00:16,290 --> 00:00:18,170
These buildings seem to be rented out by their owners.

7
00:00:18,570 --> 00:00:20,650
Made into a place similar to a B&B

8
00:00:21,580 --> 00:00:22,940
It seems we have to be more careful

9
00:00:23,340 --> 00:00:24,620
Is it possible that they are targeting us?

10
00:00:27,420 --> 00:00:29,500
Not enough food, I know

11
00:00:29,980 --> 00:00:31,780
We need to go to the residential area below

12
00:00:31,940 --> 00:00:33,140
There should be a convenience store over there

13
00:00:33,540 --> 00:00:34,940
Five people divided into two groups

14
00:00:35,140 --> 00:00:36,140
A group looking for food

15
00:00:36,380 --> 00:00:37,340
A group drives around in a circle

16
00:00:37,340 --> 00:00:43,610
Is there anyone willing to attract Fengzi's attention? I'll add one. I'll come too.

17
00:00:44,800 --> 00:00:46,360
Want to survive in this world

18
00:00:46,880 --> 00:00:51,450
Can't sit still and wait for death. Add me and I'll go.

19
00:00:56,460 --> 00:00:58,960
Then I'll stay here and we'll move at night

20
00:01:05,690 --> 00:01:07,490
You can turn right on the road ahead and the convenience store is on the left

21
00:01:07,770 --> 00:01:09,450
But there are more than ten winds on that road

22
00:01:09,730 --> 00:01:11,010
Gather again

23
00:01:11,940 --> 00:01:14,180
Lure them away as planned to receive
